@startuml 02_level2_p1
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

title PPMP - Level 2 decomposition of 1.0
rectangle "All authenticated roles / login user" as U
rectangle "System Administrator" as A
usecase "6.0\nRecord Audit Events and Notifications" as P6
database "D1 Identity and Access\nusers, departments, memberships, roles,\npermissions, role assignments, sessions" as D1
usecase "1.1\nAuthenticate Session" as P11
usecase "1.2\nValidate Account and Role Changes" as P12
usecase "1.3\nPersist Access and Return Result" as P13

U --> P11 : F001 Login / logout / session request\n[AUTH]
P11 --> U : F002 Authentication result\n[AUTH_RESULT]
A --> P12 : F003 Account and department access changes\n[ACCOUNT_CHANGE]
P13 --> A : F004 Account administration result\n[ACCESS_RESULT]
D1 --> P11 : F005 Identity, access and session records\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
P13 --> D1 : F006 Validated accounts, access and sessions\n[ACCESS_WRITE]
P13 --> P6 : F060 Process 1.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P11 --> P12 : 1.01 Authenticated administrator context\n[AUTH_RESULT]
P11 --> P13 : 1.02 Validated session outcome\n[AUTH_RESULT]
P12 --> P13 : 1.03 Authorized access mutation\n[VERIFIED_ACCESS_CHANGE]
P13 --> P11 : 1.04 Persisted session result\n[AUTH_RESULT]
legend bottom
Rectangle = external role; oval = data-transforming process
Cylinder = logical data store; arrow = named data payload
U groups all roles for shared login, reports and inbox functions.
Numbered process peers in Level 2 are outside the decomposed process.
Packet fields: FLOW_REGISTER.md; relationships: DATA_DICTIONARY.md
endlegend
@enduml
